                                                "sense_id": "aaac31ad-9439-3629-8af4-04546857d727",
                                                "text": "“Scoliosis,” Mwita said. “Curvature of the spine. It’s hereditary, but that doesn’t always explain it. Most common in girls, but boys get it, too.”"
                                            }
